Hello all,

I am attempting
to find the extreme shapes for a PCA. The code runs correctly and produces a phylomorphospace. However, in the gm.prcomp output, the ‘shapes’ value is not returned. All
other values are listed within the object (see attached screenshot).

The line I ran to produce the object is as follows:
paturon.pca<-gm.prcomp(paturon_coords, phy = tree, align.to.phy = FALSE)

I am using geomorph v 4.0.4, which I believe
is the latest package version available on CRAN. I’m not sure if there was a
change in how shape values are produced or it this is an error on my end.

Thank you for your time,

Cori

