From uaab55242ff4da6c6 at groups.google.com  Sat Dec 31 13:01:04 2022
From: uaab55242ff4da6c6 at groups.google.com (Mike Collyer)
Date: Sat, 31 Dec 2022 13:01:04 +0000
Subject: Re: [geomorph-r-package] Error when I trying to assess evolutionary allometry with procD.pgls
Message-ID: <RcRzcuADUF0.De6YvQYtBQAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <RcRzcuADUF0.jDA0i3ijBAAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
References: <RcRzcuADUF0.jDA0i3ijBAAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/geomorph-r-package/c/RcRzcuADUF0/m/De6YvQYtBQAJ>
